<<set $anaTalkedTo to true>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The woman before you is decked out in studded leather garments and steel-toed cleats. Her long black hair is kept out of her face with a red headband crowned in metallic silver.][/nomarkup]
{$bartender}: Ma'am, for the last time, I'm not responsible for the music. Go ask the DJ. 
{$anastasia}: He told me to talk to you. You Tories are giving me more run around than the church.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She speaks with a thick Eastern European accent.][/nomarkup]
{$anastasia}: C'mon, you know you can play something harder.
{$bartender}: Look, there's a lot of different clubs in the area. If you don't like it here go somewhere else.
{$anastasia}: [nomarkup][Scoffs.][/nomarkup] This is why I left Europe.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The bartender locks eyes with you, silently pleading for help.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: I agree. This music sucks.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The punk turns her attention towards you now, half-grinning, half-sneering.][/nomarkup]
{$anastasia}: You hear it too!? All noise, no skill. Guys more worried about their mohawks than their guitar skills. 
{$bartender}: [nomarkup][Under her breath.][/nomarkup] Don't get paid enough for this.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][An uneasy beat passes. The bartender busies herself with a stack of glasses, pretending not to hear.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: I'll have a Bloody Mary. (Pay 5$) <<if GetCurrentMoney() >= 5>> #line:097575b 
    {$bartender}: Coming right up!
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She rushes to the other end of the bar and starts making your drink, clearly grateful for the distraction.][/nomarkup] #line:0d7a9d5 
    <<GiveItem "IT_Q_EMBASSYDRINK">>
    <<RemoveMoney 5>>
-> [nomarkup][Say nothing.][/nomarkup] #line:06df652 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][After a few long seconds, the Bartender realizes she's on her own. She huffs out a deep sigh.][/nomarkup] 
    {$bartender}: Ma'am, you're welcome to discuss the venue's music choice with Security if you like.
    {$anastasia}: Fascist, much. At least it would get  in here.
